  "Scope": "Fixed 505bc140 -\u003E 47d7273e public PythonRe Subn/retained template operations, text compatibility and unchanged Count controls. Native source bridge decodes the full template per call in both old/new controls; the new overload takes the same UTF-8 bytes. Cold cycles 32 same-size templates through the existing 16-entry cache; warm reuses one. Regex/template/subject setup outside timing. Funded lanes include receipt access/disposal; caller byte aliases remain valid. Complete output batches are compared after timing; original live token and all four finite controls included. Warmup 1.5s/minimum1000 calls/lane, independent80ms calibration,3alternating samples,all\u003E=20ms. One120s cap,at most one focused confirmation. No catalog/cumulative/package claim.",
